{"id": "22-1498-2-8", "zh": "在 si 之前，中性以外的 ima 变为 ayaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1498-9-10", "zh": "si 省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1499-2-46", "zh": "Ayaṃ itthī（这个女人），imā，imāyo，imaṃ，imā，imāyo，imāya，imassā，imissā，imāhi，imābhi，imāya，imassā，imassāya，imissā，imissāya，imissaṃ，assā，assāya，imāsaṃ，imāsānaṃ，āsaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1499-47-52", "zh": "从格的形式与具格相同，属格的形式与为格相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1499-53-74", "zh": "Imāya，imāyaṃ，imassā，imassāya，imassaṃ，imissā，imissāya，imissaṃ，assā，assaṃ，imāsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1500-2-10", "zh": "Ayaṃ puriso（这个男人），ime，imaṃ，ime。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1501-2-26", "zh": "223. Nāmhinimi（在 nā 之前，ima 变为 ana、imi）〔ka.171；rū.219；nī.357；多本作‘nāmhanimhi’〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1502-2-9", "zh": "在 nā 之前，非阴性的 ima 替换为 ana 和 imi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1503-2-9", "zh": "Iminā，anena，imehi，imebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1504-2-20", "zh": "224. Imassānitthiyaṃ ṭe（非阴性中 ima 可变为 e）〔ka.170；rū.220；nī.356〕。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1505-2-13", "zh": "在非阴性中，于 su、naṃ、hi 之前，ima 可选地变为 ṭe（即 e）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1506-2-57", "zh": "Ehi，ebhi，imassa，assa，imesaṃ，imesānaṃ，esaṃ，esānaṃ，imasmā，imamhā，asmā，amhā，imehi，imebhi，ehi，ebhi，imassa，assa，imesaṃ，imesānaṃ，esaṃ，esānaṃ，imasmiṃ，imamhi，asmiṃ，amhi，imesu，esu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1507-2-39", "zh": "圣典中“Anamhi bhadde susoṇe, kinnu jagghasi sobhane”〔jā.1.5.130（作 anamhi kāle susoṇi）〕一句，其中‘anamhī’这一处，是依大规则在 smiṃ 之前替换为 ana。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-1508-2-4", "zh": "Imaṃ cittaṃ（这颗心）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1509-2-20", "zh": "225. Imassidaṃ vā（ima 可选地变为 idaṃ）〔ka.129；rū.222；nī.305〕。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1510-2-15", "zh": "在中性中，于 aṃ、si 之前，ima 与 aṃ、si 一起可选地变为 idaṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1511-2-17", "zh": "Idaṃ cittaṃ（这颗心），imāni cittāni（这些心），imaṃ，idaṃ，imāni，iminā，anena。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1511-18-20", "zh": "其余全都与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1512-2-5", "zh": "这里说明混合形式：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1513-2-56", "zh": "Yā，sā itthī（那个女人），yā，tā itthiyo，yaṃ，taṃ itthiṃ，yā，esā itthī，yā，etā itthiyo，yaṃ，etaṃ itthiṃ，yā，ayaṃ itthī，yā，imā itthiyo，yaṃ，imaṃ itthiṃ，yo，so puriso，ye，te purisā，等等。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1514-2-30", "zh": "在“Sa kho so kumāro vuddhimanvāyā”（那个童子长大以后）这句中，应当理解为 so so kumāro；在‘ese se eke ekatthe’这句中，应当理解为 eso so eko ekattho。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1514-31-39", "zh": "其中，每组前面的是实义词，后面的只是语音成分。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-1514-40-66", "zh": "但在“Ayaṃ so sārathi etī”（这就是那位车夫来了）〔jā.2.22.51〕这句中，两个词都各自是实义词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1514-67-80", "zh": "yaṃ、taṃ、idaṃ 这些词也会以不变词的形式出现在圣典语句中，在一切性和格中形式都不变。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1515-2-21", "zh": "226. Imetānamenānvādese dutiyāyaṃ（重提时，在第二格中 ima、eta 变为 ena）〔nī.375-6 页；pā.2.4.34〕。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1516-2-15", "zh": "所谓重提（anvādesa），是指随后再说、再次提起；在重提的场合，于第二格的格尾之前，ima、eta 替换为 ena。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1517-2-29", "zh": "应当这样说：Imaṃ bhikkhuṃ vinayaṃ ajjhāpehi（你教这位比丘律），atho enaṃ bhikkhuṃ dhammaṃ ajjhāpehi（然后再教这位比丘法）；ime bhikkhū vinayaṃ ajjhāpehi，atho ene bhikkhū dhammaṃ ajjhāpehi；etaṃ bhikkhuṃ vinayaṃ ajjhāpehi，等等。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1517-30-56", "zh": "在 Tamenaṃ bhikkhave nirayapālā〔a.ni.3.36〕、yatvādhikaraṇamenaṃ bhikkhuṃ〔dī.ni.1.213〕等句中，也同样是重提。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1518-2-19", "zh": "227. Massāmussa（amu 的 m 变为 s）〔ka.173；rū.223；nī.359〕。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1519-2-8", "zh": "在 si 之前，非中性的 amu 的 m 变为 s。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1520-2-59", "zh": "Asu itthī（那个女人），或作 amu，amū，amuyo，amuṃ，amū，amuyo，amuyā，amussā，amūhi，amūbhi，amuyā，amussā，amūsaṃ，amūsānaṃ，amuyā，amussā，amūhi，amūbhi，amuyā，amussā，amūsaṃ，amūsānaṃ，amuyā，amuyaṃ，amussā，amussaṃ，amūsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1521-2-7", "zh": "Asu puriso（那个男人），或作 amu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1522-2-19", "zh": "228. Lopomusmā（在 amu 之后省略）〔ka.118；rū.146；nī.293〕。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1523-2-6", "zh": "在 amu 之后，yo 省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1523-7-23", "zh": "这是‘Vo, no’规则的例外〔ka.119；rū.155；nī.294〕。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-1524-2-14", "zh": "Amū，amuṃ，amū，amunā，amūhi，amūbhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1525-2-8", "zh": "229. Na no sassa（sa 不变为 no）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1526-2-7", "zh": "在 amu 之后，sa 不变为 no。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1527-2-3", "zh": "Amussa。", "confidence": 92}
{"id": "22-1528-2-8", "zh": "依大规则，在 sa 之前，mu 变为 du，得 adussa。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1528-9-34", "zh": "圣典中“dussa me khettapālassa, rattiṃ bhattaṃ apābhatan”（那个看田人夜里没有给我送饭来）〔jā.1.4.62〕一句，是因偈颂的缘故省略了 a 音。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-1528-35-60", "zh": "Amūsaṃ，amūsānaṃ，amusmā，amumhā，amūhi，amūbhi，amussa，adussa，amūsaṃ，amūsānaṃ，amusmiṃ，amumhi，amūsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1529-2-19", "zh": "230. Amussāduṃ（amu 变为 aduṃ）〔ka.130；rū.225；nī.308〕。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1530-2-12", "zh": "在中性中，于 aṃ、si 之前，amu 与 aṃ、si 一起可选地变为 aduṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1531-2-15", "zh": "Amuṃ cittaṃ（那颗心），aduṃ cittaṃ，amūni，amuṃ，aduṃ，amūni。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1531-16-18", "zh": "其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1531-19-28", "zh": "依‘Sakatthe’这条规则加上 ka 词缀之后，就没有代词类的变化形式了。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-1531-29-35", "zh": "Amukā kaññā（某某少女），amukā，amukāyo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1531-36-41", "zh": "Amuko puriso（某某男人），amukā purisā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1531-42-48", "zh": "Amukaṃ cittaṃ（某某心），amukāni cittāni，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1532-2-7", "zh": "231. Ke vā（在 ka 之前可选）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1533-2-9", "zh": "后面接 ka 时，amu 的 m 可选地变为 s。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1534-2-8", "zh": "Asukā itthī（某某女人），asukā，asukāyo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1534-9-14", "zh": "Asuko puriso（某某男人），asukā purisā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1534-15-20", "zh": "Asukaṃ kulaṃ（某某家族），asukāni kulāni。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1534-21-27", "zh": "全都分别与 kaññā、purisa、citta 的变化相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1535-2-16", "zh": "在‘Itthiyamatvā’这条规则中，依拆分出来的规则‘itthiyaṃ ā’，kiṃ 一词在阴性中加 ā 词缀。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-1536-2-31", "zh": "232. Kiṃssa ko（kiṃ 变为 ka）〔ka.227-9；rū.270、226；nī.456-7-8；多本作‘kissa ko sabbāsu’〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1537-2-8", "zh": "在一切格尾和词缀之前，kiṃ 变为 ka。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1538-2-20", "zh": "Kā itthī（哪个女人），kā，kāyo，kaṃ，kā，kāyo，kāya，kassā，等等，全都与 sabba 相同。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-1538-21-38", "zh": "Ko puriso（哪个男人），ke purisā，kaṃ，ke，kena，kehi，kebhi，kassa。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1539-2-8", "zh": "233. Ki sasmiṃsu vānitthiyaṃ（非阴性中，在 sa、smiṃ 之前可选地变为 ki）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1540-2-10", "zh": "在非阴性中，于 sa、smiṃ 之前，kiṃ 一词可选地变为 ki。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1541-2-33", "zh": "Kissa，kesaṃ，kesānaṃ，kasmā，kamhā，kehi，kebhi，kassa，kissa，kesaṃ，kesānaṃ，kasmiṃ，kamhi，kismiṃ，kimhi，kesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1542-2-17", "zh": "234. Kimaṃsisu napuṃsake（中性中，在 aṃ、si 之前变为 kiṃ）〔多本作‘kimaṃsisu saha napuṃsake’〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1543-2-12", "zh": "在中性中，于 aṃ、si 之前，kiṃ 一词与 aṃ、si 一起变为 kiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1544-2-13", "zh": "Kiṃ cittaṃ（什么心），kāni，kiṃ，或作 kaṃ，kāni。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1544-14-16", "zh": "其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1544-17-21", "zh": "这是表示疑问义的单纯 kiṃ 一词的变化形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1545-2-13", "zh": "但与不变词‘ci’结合时，就表示‘某些’或‘少许’的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-1545-14-38", "zh": "Kāci itthī（某个女人），kāci itthiyo，kiñci itthiṃ，kāci，kāyaci，kāhici，kāyaci，kassāci，kāsañci，kutoci，kāhici。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1545-39-46", "zh": "处格：kāyaci，katthaci，kāsuci。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1546-2-26", "zh": "Koci puriso（某个男人），keci，kiñci，keci，kenaci，kehici，kassaci，kesañci，kismiñci，kimhici，katthaci，kesuci。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1547-2-11", "zh": "Kiñci kulaṃ（某个家族），kānici kulāni，kiñci，kānici。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-1547-12-14", "zh": "其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-1548-2-8", "zh": "再者，与 ya 一词结合时，就表示全部的意思。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-1548-9-15", "zh": "Yā kāci itthī（无论哪个女人），yā kāci itthiyo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1549-2-47", "zh": "Yo koci puriso（无论哪个男人），ye keci，yaṃ kiñci，ye keci，yena kenaci，yehi kehici，yassa kassaci，yesaṃ kesañci，yato kutoci，yehi kehici，yassa kassaci，yesaṃ kesañci，yasmiṃ kismiñci，yamhi kimhici，yattha katthaci，yesu kesuci。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1550-2-13", "zh": "Yaṃ kiñci cittaṃ（无论什么心），yāni kānici，yaṃ kiñci，yāni kānici。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1550-14-16", "zh": "其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 90}
